The '''Auger Rod''' was a {{Legendary}} [[Fishing Rod]] unlockable at {{CollectionLink|Ice X}}. It required {{Skill|Fishing|25}} to be used. It broke nearby ice where it is cast. However, the rod did not break any ice blocks if the user was sneaking, excluding the block it was directly on. It increased the [[Sea Creatures#Sea Creature Weight|Weight]] of [[Sea Creatures#Winter|winter sea creatures]] by {{Green|200%}}.

